{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Greetings, brave adventurer! Welcome to <i>Croak Crusader: Champion of Canada</i>, a fast-paced, momentum-based action platformer where precision, skill, and grit are your ultimate allies. When the Roachilla Empire (grotesque alien bio-experiments created by the sinister Professor Creature) threatens the Great White North, it\u2019s up to the indomitable Captain Croak to swing into action and save the day. Armed with a versatile grapple and fueled by unrelenting determination, you\u2019ll dash, leap, and battle through a gauntlet of explosive, white-knuckle challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a vibrant world of forgotten bomb factories, sprawling circuses, and shadowy jungle ruins, each teeming with traps and enemies that demand lightning-fast reflexes and razor-sharp precision. The gameplay is difficult but deeply rewarding, blending tight platforming mechanics with fluid momentum and thrilling combat. Every step forward is a test of your skill, every enemy encounter an opportunity for satisfying chaos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With its stunning black-and-white visuals inspired by the golden age of cinema and the chaotic energy of Hollywood Z-movies, <i>Croak Crusader</i> isn\u2019t just a game: it\u2019s an unforgettable journey. Will you conquer the impossible and save the Land of the Maple Leaf, or will the Roachilla Empire prevail? The fate of Canada is in your hands.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3152060?t=1772240451","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3152060?t=1772240451","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3152060/e1dfb2a148be1547af6903d9c583e5e11e86dd56/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772240451","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3152060/e1dfb2a148be1547af6903d9c583e5e11e86dd56/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1772240451","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"Croak Crusader: The Champion of Canada features blood and gore particles produced from killing enemies. Similar stylistically to a Quentin Tarantino film."},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Greetings, brave adventurer! Welcome to <i>Croak Crusader: Champion of Canada</i>, a fast-paced, momentum-based action platformer where precision, skill, and grit are your ultimate allies. When the Roachilla Empire (grotesque alien bio-experiments created by the sinister Professor Creature) threatens the Great White North, it\u2019s up to the indomitable Captain Croak to swing into action and save the day. Armed with a versatile grapple and fueled by unrelenting determination, you\u2019ll dash, leap, and battle through a gauntlet of explosive, white-knuckle challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a vibrant world of forgotten bomb factories, sprawling circuses, and shadowy jungle ruins, each teeming with traps and enemies that demand lightning-fast reflexes and razor-sharp precision. The gameplay is difficult but deeply rewarding, blending tight platforming mechanics with fluid momentum and thrilling combat. Every step forward is a test of your skill, every enemy encounter an opportunity for satisfying chaos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With its stunning black-and-white visuals inspired by the golden age of cinema and the chaotic energy of Hollywood Z-movies, <i>Croak Crusader</i> isn\u2019t just a game: it\u2019s an unforgettable journey. Will you conquer the impossible and save the Land of the Maple Leaf, or will the Roachilla Empire prevail? The fate of Canada is in your hands.</p>","developers":["TunawareDevs"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventur